Package: freebox-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-keyring
Description: Freebox OS CLI and interactive terminal application
 Provides the fbx command, including DHCP inspection and button-based pairing.
 Stores per-user credentials under the XDG configuration directory.
 The optional upstream MCP extra is not included in this package.
